WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.485
Minwoo: Mom, we're hungry.

2
00:00:03.486 --> 00:00:09.803
Minwoo's Mom: What do you like?

3
00:00:09.804 --> 00:00:11.884
Sally: I like chicken.

4
00:00:11.885 --> 00:00:16.466
Minwoo: I don't like chicken.

5
00:00:16.467 --> 00:00:18.990
Peter: I like salad.

6
00:00:18.991 --> 00:00:23.964
Sally: I don't like salad.

7
00:00:23.965 --> 00:00:26.182
Minwoo: I like noodles.

8
00:00:26.183 --> 00:00:28.073
Sally: I want noodles!

9
00:00:28.074 --> 00:00:31.433
Peter: I don't want noodles.

10
00:00:31.434 --> 00:00:40.980
Minwoo's Mom: Lunch is over!

